# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# This matters beyond tidiness here: the sandbox's dependency cache is keyed on
# a hash of package-lock.json, so a checkout that flips CRLF/LF changes the key
# and misses the cache on every run without changing a single dependency.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz  binary
*.pdf binary
